### 💥 This migration failed during rehearsal

`demo/migrations/005_not_null.sql` · rehearsed under peak-hour profile, 1,240 req/s

The migration failed on the production-shaped shadow database, so it would most likely fail in production too:

```text
ERROR: column "user_id" of relation "orders" contains null values (SQLSTATE 23502)
```

**Findings**

- 🟠 `set-not-null` — SET NOT NULL scans the whole table while holding an ACCESS EXCLUSIVE lock. _Add a CHECK (user_id IS NOT NULL) NOT VALID constraint, VALIDATE it, then SET NOT NULL._

